00:16:24,140 --> 00:16:26,320
Just give up, Wheeler. It's over.

246
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:28,209
Joey Wheeler doesn't quit.

247
00:16:28,620 --> 00:16:31,091
Maybe you'd understand if you had friends.

248
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:32,520
Come on.

249
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:35,205
That's what I'm talking about.

250
00:16:35,740 --> 00:16:39,858
I'll place one card face down, then
summon Gear Freed the Iron Knight.

251
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:44,340
You fool.

252
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:47,317
Once your knight has been
infected by my Parasite card,

253
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:50,341
It'll just be another snack
for my ravenous queen!

254
00:16:51,780 --> 00:16:54,220
Don't be so sure about that, Weevil.

255
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:56,780
Some cards are bug-proof. What's wrong?

256
00:16:57,460 --> 00:16:59,780
Why can't the parasite feed on it?

257
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:02,900
He's Gearfree, the Iron Knight.

258
00:17:03,140 --> 00:17:06,700
And that slimy parasite's
helpless against his metal armor.

259
00:17:07,300 --> 00:17:13,420
Gearfree, the Iron Knight, attack his
queen's eggs, and lower her attack power!

260
00:17:17,060 --> 00:17:17,960
That's it!

261
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,788
Next turn, you're bug food!

262
00:17:21,120 --> 00:17:22,240
Goodbye, Wheeler.

263
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:24,360
And now, my lovely queen,

264
00:17:24,660 --> 00:17:28,719
destroy his scrap heap of a knight
and what's left of his life point!

265
00:17:29,660 --> 00:17:33,400
You grub, I was hoping you
would attack me. You were?

266
00:17:33,700 --> 00:17:35,240
All part of my plan.

267
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:37,300
Activate the trap card.

268
00:17:37,620 --> 00:17:38,740
Grave robber!

269
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:44,260
That's grave robber Yep,

270
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:46,977
he can take a card from
your graveyard and use it

271
00:17:47,060 --> 00:17:50,340
against you And he just
nabbed you a can of aerosol

272
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:53,320
Time to exterminate your queen

273
00:18:01,380 --> 00:18:05,900
Yeah, there goes my best problem
What have you done to my queen?

274
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,597
But wait.

275
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:10,327
I'm not true with you
yet, Weevil Underpants.

276
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:14,745
Gearfield, destroy his last egg
and the rest of his life points.

277
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:18,700
Welcome to Loserville, Weevil.

278
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:20,240
Population, you.

279
00:18:20,500 --> 00:18:21,720
I lost?

280
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:23,118
I don't believe it.

281
00:18:25,180 --> 00:18:27,080
All right, Weevil, cough him up.

282
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:29,980
You're Insect Queen and two Locator Cards.

283
00:18:30,860 --> 00:18:31,957
Any last words?

284
00:18:32,040 --> 00:18:33,157
Yes, six.

285
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:36,160
This duel is not over yet.

286
00:18:36,340 --> 00:18:39,580
So I'll play this, Return of the Doomed.

287
00:18:39,740 --> 00:18:43,211
It brings back one of my monsters
and hides it under water.

288
00:18:44,260 --> 00:18:45,317
All right, Mako.

289
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:46,420
Here goes.

290
00:18:47,100 --> 00:18:48,160
Giant True Name.

291
00:18:48,580 --> 00:18:50,557
This card sends all magic and trap cards

292
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:52,437
back to the player's
hands and off the field.

293
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:55,437
So I could use it to dry
up Mako's ocean and expose

294
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:57,877
whatever monster he brought
back from his graveyard.

295
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:00,200
What on earth are you waiting for?

296
00:19:00,660 --> 00:19:02,297
Activate Giant True Name.

297
00:19:02,380 --> 00:19:04,020
Drain the scene!

298
00:19:11,140 --> 00:19:12,220
It worked!

299
00:19:12,620 --> 00:19:14,400
Now I play scapegoat.

300
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:18,940
And I sacrifice one of them so
my panther warrior can attack.

301
00:19:25,020 --> 00:19:26,600
He did it!

302
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:31,637
Yes, that was an excellent duel.
Congratulations. Thank you.

303
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,440
Here are my two rarest cars.

304
00:19:33,760 --> 00:19:36,140
And two locator cars. That's right.

305
00:19:38,060 --> 00:19:39,020
Thank you.

306
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:40,920
And don't worry.

307
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:43,220
I'll treat it with respect.

308
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:44,880
You'd better.

309
00:19:45,180 --> 00:19:47,200
And best of luck in the finals.

310
00:19:47,660 --> 00:19:49,280
Not to worry, my friends.

311
00:19:49,620 --> 00:19:52,080
I promise I'll set you free.

312
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:55,320
Look, the rare hunter's hideout.

313
00:19:55,480 --> 00:19:56,600
It's just up ahead.

314
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:58,820
Begin our descent immediately.

315
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:00,170
Yes, Mr.

316
00:20:00,253 --> 00:20:01,083
Kaiba.

317
00:20:01,166 --> 00:20:01,996
All right, this is it.

318
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:06,057
No matter what happens down there,
I'm not leaving without my friends.

319
00:20:06,140 --> 00:20:08,375
You won't get away with this, Merrick!
